DTSTAMP:20260820T033111Z
DTSTART:20260828T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Cup of Joey on Friday\, August 28\, 2026 is canceled. \nWhat is
	 the purpose of Cup of Joey? It is to create a connected culture of coffee
	 shop-open networking across our region. Every Friday morning\, you’ll hav
	e the opportunity to meet new and expand your current networks\, talk abou
	t tech\, inspire innovation\, and create community. \nSo\, what is the dif
	ference between a cup of joe and a Cup of Joe-Y? It is the WHY. It’s not w
	hat you do. It is why you do it! \nAt the Ion\, these are questions that w
	e want to explore with the tech and innovation community. So\, show up\, b
	e friendly\, and make new connections. Know your why\, and we will get to 
	the future together. \nThe future is only a cup away. \nRegister Here: htt
	ps://www.cupofjoey.org/\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/ion-networking-wi
	th-cup-of-joey-34-4/\n\nFrom Ion District
